-- 최정우 교수 회신 반영 (2026-11-17, 한글 파일). 받은 항목만 바꾸고 나머지 칸(직함·사진·전화 등)은 그대로 둔다. 여러 번 실행해도 결과가 같다.

update faculty set
  bio_ko = $q$<h3>학력</h3><ul><li>서강대학교 화학공학 1982 공학사</li><li>서강대학교 화학공학 1984 공학석사</li><li>Rutgers University 화학생물공학 1990 공학박사</li><li>Tokyo Institute of Technology 생물분자공학 2003 박사</li><li>University of Durham 2006 MBA</li><li>University of Durham 경영학 2017 박사</li></ul><h3>경력</h3><ul><li>서강대학교 화공생명공학과 교수 (1990–2025)</li><li>서강대학교 공과대학 학장</li><li>서강대학교 화공생명공학과 로욜라 석학교수 (2025–현재)</li></ul><h3>주요 수상</h3><ul><li>과학기술훈장 웅비장</li><li>옥조근정훈장</li><li>대통령 표창</li><li>국무총리 표창</li><li>과학기술정보통신부 장관 표창</li><li>보건복지부 장관 표창</li><li>수당상 (응용과학 부문)</li><li>국가연구개발 우수성과 100선 4회 선정</li><li>World Top 2% Scientists 5회 선정</li></ul><h3>학회 활동</h3><ul><li>한국공학한림원 화학생물공학분과 위원장 (2023–2024)</li><li>한국공학한림원 정회원·원로회원 (2021–현재)</li><li>국가과학기술자문회의 심의회의 생명의료전문위원회 위원 (2020–2021)</li><li>한국과학기술한림원 정회원 (2018–현재)</li><li>한국생물공학회 회장 (2017)</li><li>한국바이오칩학회 회장 (2007)</li></ul><h3>주요 논문</h3><ul><li>"Human Nervous System-Based Biohybrid Robot-On-A-Chip with Sensing Function for Toxicity Screening," <em>Advanced Science</em> (2025)</li><li>"Glioblastoma-midbrain assembloid-based Electrophysiological sensor composed of dual-channel flexible Au nanodot patterned electrodes to evaluate cancer drug," <em>Biosensors &amp; Bioelectronics</em> (2025)</li><li>"Human Motor System-Based Biohybrid Robot-On-a-Chip for Drug Evaluation of Neurodegenerative Disease," <em>Advanced Science</em> (2023)</li><li>"A Nano-biohybrid-based Bio-Solar Cell to Regulate the Electrical Signal Transmission to Living Cells for Biomedical Application," <em>Advanced Materials</em> (2023)</li><li>"Ultrasensitive Electrochemical Detection of Mutated Viral RNAs with Single-Nucleotide Resolution using a Nanoporous Electrode Array (NPEA)," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2022)</li><li>"Clustered Regularly Interspaced Short Palindromic Repeats-Mediated Amplification-Free Detection of Viral DNAs Using Surface-Enhanced Raman Spectroscopy-Active Nanoarray," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2021)</li><li>"Hybrid Graphene-Gold Nanoparticle-Based Nucleic Acid Conjugates for Cancer-Specific Multimodal Imaging and Combined Therapeutics," <em>Advanced Functional Materials</em> (2020)</li><li>"Nondestructive Characterization of Stem Cell Neurogenesis by a Magneto-Plasmonic Nanomaterial-Based Exosomal miRNA Detection," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2019)</li><li>"Nondestructive Real-Time Monitoring of Enhanced Stem Cell Differentiation Using a Graphene-Au Hybrid Nanoelectrode Array," <em>Advanced Materials</em> (2018) – Cover Paper</li><li>"Phototactic Guidance of a Tissue-Engineered Soft-Robotic Ray," <em>Science</em> (2016) – Cover Paper</li></ul>$q$,
  bio_en = $q$<h3>Education</h3><ul><li>B.S., Chemical Engineering, Sogang University (1982)</li><li>M.S., Chemical Engineering, Sogang University (1984)</li><li>Ph.D., Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, Rutgers University (1990)</li><li>Ph.D., Biomolecular Engineering, Tokyo Institute of Technology (2003)</li><li>MBA, University of Durham (2006)</li><li>Doctorate, Business Administration, University of Durham (2017)</li></ul><h3>Experience</h3><ul><li>Professor, Department of Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, Sogang University (1990–2025)</li><li>Dean, College of Engineering, Sogang University</li><li>Loyola Distinguished Professor, Department of Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, Sogang University (2025–present)</li></ul><h3>Selected Awards</h3><ul><li>Order of Science and Technology Merit, Woongbi Medal</li><li>Okjo Order of Service Merit</li><li>Presidential Commendation</li><li>Prime Minister's Commendation</li><li>Commendation of the Minister of Science and ICT</li><li>Commendation of the Minister of Health and Welfare</li><li>Sudang Prize (Applied Science)</li><li>Selected four times for the National R&amp;D Excellence 100</li><li>Named five times among the World's Top 2% Scientists</li></ul><h3>Professional Service</h3><ul><li>Chair, Division of Chemical and Biological Engineering, National Academy of Engineering of Korea (2023–2024)</li><li>Member and Senior Member, National Academy of Engineering of Korea (2021–present)</li><li>Member, Special Committee on Life Science and Medicine, Deliberative Council, Presidential Advisory Council on Science and Technology (2020–2021)</li><li>Member, Korean Academy of Science and Technology (2018–present)</li><li>President, Korean Society for Biotechnology and Bioengineering (2017)</li><li>President, Korean BioChip Society (2007)</li></ul><h3>Selected Publications</h3><ul><li>"Human Nervous System-Based Biohybrid Robot-On-A-Chip with Sensing Function for Toxicity Screening," <em>Advanced Science</em> (2025)</li><li>"Glioblastoma-midbrain assembloid-based Electrophysiological sensor composed of dual-channel flexible Au nanodot patterned electrodes to evaluate cancer drug," <em>Biosensors &amp; Bioelectronics</em> (2025)</li><li>"Human Motor System-Based Biohybrid Robot-On-a-Chip for Drug Evaluation of Neurodegenerative Disease," <em>Advanced Science</em> (2023)</li><li>"A Nano-biohybrid-based Bio-Solar Cell to Regulate the Electrical Signal Transmission to Living Cells for Biomedical Application," <em>Advanced Materials</em> (2023)</li><li>"Ultrasensitive Electrochemical Detection of Mutated Viral RNAs with Single-Nucleotide Resolution using a Nanoporous Electrode Array (NPEA)," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2022)</li><li>"Clustered Regularly Interspaced Short Palindromic Repeats-Mediated Amplification-Free Detection of Viral DNAs Using Surface-Enhanced Raman Spectroscopy-Active Nanoarray," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2021)</li><li>"Hybrid Graphene-Gold Nanoparticle-Based Nucleic Acid Conjugates for Cancer-Specific Multimodal Imaging and Combined Therapeutics," <em>Advanced Functional Materials</em> (2020)</li><li>"Nondestructive Characterization of Stem Cell Neurogenesis by a Magneto-Plasmonic Nanomaterial-Based Exosomal miRNA Detection," <em>ACS Nano</em> (2019)</li><li>"Nondestructive Real-Time Monitoring of Enhanced Stem Cell Differentiation Using a Graphene-Au Hybrid Nanoelectrode Array," <em>Advanced Materials</em> (2018) – Cover Paper</li><li>"Phototactic Guidance of a Tissue-Engineered Soft-Robotic Ray," <em>Science</em> (2016) – Cover Paper</li></ul>$q$,
  research_ko = $q$<p>나노바이오센서<br>나노기술을 기반으로 질병을 진단하는 바이오센서를 개발합니다.</p><p>오가노이드 온 어 칩<br>어셈블로이드로 구성되어 약물 스크리닝 기능을 갖춘 바이오칩을 개발합니다.</p><p>합성배아 온 어 칩<br>합성 배아로 구성되어 노화·역노화와 태아 유해 물질을 측정하는 바이오칩을 개발합니다.</p><p>바이오하이브리드 로봇<br>바이오하이브리드 로봇으로 구성되어 독성 평가와 약물 스크리닝 기능을 갖춘 바이오칩을 개발합니다.</p>$q$,
  research_en = $q$<p>Nanobiosensors<br>We develop nanotechnology-based biosensors for disease diagnosis.</p><p>Organoid-on-a-Chip<br>We develop biochips built from assembloids for drug screening.</p><p>Synthetic Embryo-on-a-Chip<br>We develop biochips built from synthetic embryos to measure aging and rejuvenation and to detect substances harmful to the fetus.</p><p>Biohybrid Robots<br>We develop biochips built from biohybrid robots for toxicity evaluation and drug screening.</p>$q$,
  lab_ko = $q$나노바이오전자 소자 연구실$q$,
  lab_en = $q$Nanobioelectronics Lab$q$,
  lab_url = $q$https://nbel.sogang.ac.kr$q$,
  building = $q$F$q$,
  room = $q$205$q$,
  office = $q$포스코 프란치스코관(F) 205호$q$,
  keywords = $q$Biochemical Engineering, Nanobiotechnology, Biorobotics$q$
where name_ko = '최정우';

select name_ko, title_ko, lab_ko, lab_url, office, keywords, length(bio_ko) bio_ko, length(bio_en) bio_en, length(research_ko) res_ko, length(research_en) res_en from faculty where name_ko = '최정우';
